    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "More and more young people in China are turning to "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "guzi"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Their "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on guzi is even benefiting the country’s economy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Guzi sounds like the English word “goods”. It means “grain” in Chinese. The term refers to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " related to ACGN—anime, comics, games, and novels. Items include badges, cards, soft toys, and more. The act of buying these products is called “eating guzi”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "According to an earlier report, China’s guzi economy is expected to continue growing "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Last year, it was worth 60 billion "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". By 2026, the market size will be around 110.1 billion "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Shops "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " these products are springing up around the country. They can be found in nearly every shopping mall in major cities. Some malls even have entire floors dedicated to these products."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Guzi stores are usually filled with beautifully "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " products. Walking into such a store “feels like entering a romantic, ideal world,” said a young girl from Beijing. Shoppers often have to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for a while before they find their favourite item. Finding what they want is always a big surprise."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Most young people are buying guzi for comfort. “These items help me get through my busier days. They also "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " me not to focus on my worries about my studies,” said a college student in Chongqing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The guzi industry is rising as the “friendship "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "recession",
            "zh": "衰退"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "” becomes a growing "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in China. It’s reported that young people have an average of 2.5 close "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They want to find new ways to form relationships. Guzi culture is taking advantage of this. Guzi stores offer real-life spaces for young people to meet people with "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". By attracting young shoppers to physical stores, the guzi industry is also "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "reviving",
            "zh": "复苏"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " China’s retail sector."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
